# The SNES emulator runs a LoROM test ROM of 32 KB. The ROM is bands.sfc in gui/data/rom, which gui/data/mkroms.py makes. It draws a fixed picture and then loops, so the script is an exact test. BG1 in mode 0 shows diagonal bands of 4 colours. The Del key stops the emulator.
class exact
window 500x400
run mount -nc '#Z/hostfs' /mnt/term; games/snes /mnt/term/rom/bands.sfc
pause 3
quiet
snap rom
exit "\x7f"
